    <textbox x="166.13333333333333" y="91.33" width="369.06666666666666" height="216.84" font="Arial" font_path="/usr/share/fonts/truetype/dejavu/DejaVuSans.ttf" size="11.0" min_font_size="10.0" color="#222222" align="center" vertical_align="middle" single_line="false" max_lines="9" overflow="clip" reflow_on_resize="true" line_spacing="1.08" safety_ratio="1.0" margin_left="0" margin_right="0" margin_top="0" margin_bottom="0">Cross-Entropy Loss&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;<math-field>L_{CE} = -\sum y_i \log(\hat{y}_i)</math-field>&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Thành phần: <math-field>C</math-field> (số lớp), <math-field>y_i</math-field> (nhãn thật), <math-field>\hat{y}_i</math-field> (xác suất dự đoán).</textbox>
